WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hare House

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.710
I'll come feed you guys over
summer break, so don't worry.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:16.670
Ugh... It's sweltering today...

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.370
It just gets hotter and hotter every year...

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.240
*They get cold easily

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.710
It doesn't seem that way to me.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.880
I feel hot just looking at you!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.250
You're making it look like I'M the crazy one!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.420
Anyway, Amane-senpai, why 
did you call me here?

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.960
Swimsuits, of course! Swimsuits!

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.540
Can you predict whether or not
a certain swimsuit will attract guys?!

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.500
I guess so, but...

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.630
Please, I'm begging you!

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.040
Come swimsuit shopping with 
me and help me pick one!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.460
Sure, I suppose...

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.920
Speaking of swimsuits,

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.290
You just reminded me that

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.210
I don't own any.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.630
What?! Not even one?!

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.830
Does that mean you always go skinny-dipping
when you get in the pool?!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.170
Looks like the heat finally drove her crazy.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.450
To tell you the truth,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.860
I haven't been to the pool

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.880
Since I was a kid.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.080
But how come?

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.370
The way I see it,

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.710
Swimsuits are just underwear.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:05.830
It's embarrassing...

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.880
I guess you could never go
to the pool with Eiji-kun, huh?

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.460
But if you had a super cute swimsuit,
wouldn't you wanna show it off?

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.630
Then again, he'd pretty much be
seeing you in your underwear, right?

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.040
Personally, wearing a swimsuit in public
has never really bothered me!

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.930
Oh. Speaking of which...

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:29.500
I heard a suspicious woman has been going
around flashing people in this area lately...

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.950
Why are you bringing this up to ME?!

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:35.210
Alright, then how about we go shopping
after the closing ceremony?

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:38.130
That's perfect! You wanna come, Nanako-chan?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Kotoba harari

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.130
Kimochi fuwari

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:53.040
Noseru omoitachi

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.590
Koi ni somatteku

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:05.920
Kimi to itara ame no naka 
mo chigatta shizuku ni naru

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:09.040
Donna moji o tsuzuttara

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.210
Iroasezuni nokoru no deshou?

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:13.750
Shitterun da

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:19.670
Ima no futari wa tooi ano hi ni naru koto

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.170
Sou desho kamisama

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.630
Marumaru mizu mo konai densha mo

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.210
Motto kono shunkan ga

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:36.210
Douka eien ni tsuzuite

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.250
Nante muri ka na?

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:46.540
Poem 8:
"If Nanako Wore a
Swimsuit"

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:01.250
Nanako, there's no club meeting today, right?

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.420
Wanna grab a bite on the way home?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.420
What was that...?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.880
Looks like we're all here now.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.350
Sorry I'm late!

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.790
Kino, would you say

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.050
That you feel comfortable

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.210
Wearing a swimsuit?

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.080
I wouldn't exactly say "comfortable" in
the ordinary sense of the word,

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.960
but the pool and the beach are
a fundamental part of summer,

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.630
and I think in order to get a true summer
experience and take advantage of the season,

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.670
you have to feel the sun on
your skin and the wind in your hair.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.460
Not to mention, swimwear 
fashion changes every year,

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.130
and as an artist, I think it's important to observe
and analyze those sorts of trends

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.750
from an aesthetic standpoint. 
Don't you think?

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.540
You REALLY talk a lot...

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.790
Go for it, Tao-chan!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:56.830
Okay, okay.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.040
A swimsuit that will make you desirable, yes?

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.630
On that shelf. Fifth from the right...

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.460
and third from the top.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.540
That swimsuit will bring you
good luck in finding a man.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.420
Whoa, it's just strings!

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.250
I don't think this one's gonna work...

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:24.170
But Miss President, weren't you complaining
about wanting a boyfriend?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.880
If something like this is the only way
I can get a guy, I'm done for!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.730
These are just too much!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.050
You wanna look for something

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.420
A little cuter?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.040
OK!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.540
I'm home!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.420
Oh, welcome home, Eiji.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.800
Welcome home, Big Bro!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.130
Koto-chan's here.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.540
Said she's got somethin' 
she wants to show you.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.020
Big Sis Koto? Where is she?

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.380
I had her go wait in your room.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.840
Wha-?!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.380
What's the matter? You got somethin'
naughty lyin' around in there?

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.040
Big Bro's naughty!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.270
Welcome home, Eiji!

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:12.790
What do you think of my swimsuit?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.170
I don't think anything!

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:15.920
And what in the world are you doing here?!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.920
I wanted to show you the new swimsuit
I bought and get your opinion on it.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.330
I refuse to look!

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.920
I am a MAN!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.460
I don't give a flyin' fart 
about a woman's bare skin!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:28.220
Not Interested!!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:37.000
Oh! So THIS is the kind of 
stuff you're into, Eiji!

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:37.830
HUH?!

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.450
Wait, you're not even holding anything!

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:44.540
Where do you keep naughty stuff, Big Bro?

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:46.880
There really isn't any!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:50.330
Aww... You're no fun at all, Eiji.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:51.290
Later!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.400
Don't gimme that!

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.330
Put on some clothes, would you?!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.880
But I'd like to show your 
dad my new swimsuit, too.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.670
God, anything but that!

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.200
Look at this one, guys!

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.670
What about a swimsuit that

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.770
Looks just like a dress?

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:22.880
Nice!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.380
It's definitely your 
style. It suits you well.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.210
Although, it kind of feels like a waste...

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:30.210
Nope, it's no good!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.330
You have to pick something that'll
make Eiji-kun's heart skip a beat!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:37.800
What do I do now...?

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.460
I thought for sure that this one

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.580
Would win him over...

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.580
Nice!

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.500
No, no! You're young and beautiful!
You gotta wear a bikini!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.830
Excuse me.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:08.080
Do you carry a swimsuit with extra padding
about the size of melon buns?

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:08.920
Melon...?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.830
Everyone buy something cute?

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.000
Since we're all together, we 
might as well hit the pool!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.040
It'll be our grand unveiling!

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.790
Whoa, it's so crowded!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.210
But man, this was a great idea!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.250
Miss President.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:44.960
I see you've managed to avoid both
your untimely demise and attracting a man

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.630
by not wearing that other swimsuit.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.880
Can't you predict a future where
my demise isn't a given?!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.710
How cute!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.670
I guess someone's a little shy.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.380
So it would seem.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.250
Yup...

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.800
Speaking of which, Nanako-chan's 
taking a while.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.290
Miss President.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:15.260
You didn't happen to secretly invite Busujima-san
or anything like that, did you?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.580
I figured I shouldn't embarrass 
the poor girl like that.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.500
Besides, Eiji-kun said he 
already has plans today.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.270
Wait, so you DID try to invite him...

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:34.960
Oh! Come on out, Nanako-chan!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.000
Oh wow, you look fantastic!

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:59.010
I can't help feeling totally envious...

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:01.750
That's a lot of fidgeting!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.130
Are you THAT embarrassed?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.230
I haven't ever

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.500
Shown this much skin in public

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.670
My entire life!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.580
I guess it's a good thing 
Eiji-kun isn't here, huh?

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.990
If he were to see you in that...

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.000
N-Nanako?! What are you doing here?!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.830
I should be asking YOU that!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.800
Didn't you have other plans today?!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.830
This IS my other plans!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.710
Nanako!

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.700
Hanabi-chan said she 
wanted to go to the pool.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.670
Along with you, Big Sister!

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.880
I gotcha...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.170
But Nanako-chan can’t handle the stress
of being seen naked. Now she won't come out!

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.750
Wait, naked...?

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.420
Th-then, we'll just have 
to keep our distance.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.210
Sorry 'bout that, Nanako!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.960
I... didn't mean to stare at your swimsuit!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.290
What's the matter, Nanak-?!

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:18.710
I don't really mind

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.340
If you stare a little bit...

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.730
Just don't leave, okay?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:26.210
I-I'm not gonna stare!
Besides, I can't see anything like this!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.420
W-wait!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.830
Where was she keeping that tanzaku?

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:30.210
Note: "Tanzaku" are what 
Nanako writes her poems on.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:34.380
Wha-?! Why does that girl have boobs
that look exactly like melon buns?!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.920
Ow, ow, ow! O-ow!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.210
Nanako, your skin is so soft!

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.290
Huh?! Hanabi?! What are you doing?!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:49.170
So soft! You smell so nice! 
So smooth and squishy!

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.920
Wh-what's soft?! Hold on! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.170
I-I told you not to invade 
her personal space!

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.880
This is my favorite part of Nanako!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.210
Where are you touching her...?!

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:08.100
Waracchau kurai mattaku chigau watashitachi

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:13.650
Show window utsuru sugata sae

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:19.170
Taiyou mitai ni anata ga hohoemu to

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:27.710
Odayaka na kuuki ga nagareru

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:34.920
Arikitari na nichijou de sae mo

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:40.500
Anata to nara kagayakidasu

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.960
Tatoe nani ga okita toshitemo

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:47.130
Tamani kizutsuki kizutsuketemo

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:54.460
Nanigenai hi o shinjiteite

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.110
On the next epi-

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.510
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:01.700
Eiji and Nana-

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.280
-ko's Dad!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.540
Next Time, Poem 9
"Eiji and Nanako's Dad"
